WEBVTT

00:16:29.323 --> 00:16:31.426
It's a very painful parting.

00:16:32.482 --> 00:16:37.107
C: Well, the absence of old friends
one can endure with equanimity.

00:16:38.498 --> 00:16:40.524
But even a momentary separation

00:16:40.548 --> 00:16:44.317
from anyone whom they've just met

00:16:45.675 --> 00:16:47.941
is almost unbearable.

00:16:51.548 --> 00:16:52.748
JMR: Thank you.

00:16:55.499 --> 00:16:59.499
(Applause)